.coverage*
# GPU core dumps (ROCm writes these into cwd on an HSA abort; ~8 GB each)
gpucore.*.gpu
# ...and the plain ones the kernel writes next to them. `gpucore.*.gpu` does NOT
# match these: a 3.97 GB root-owned `core` sat untracked and unignored in this
# directory on 0915, one `git add -A` away from an unpushable commit.
/core
/core.*

# Local measurement ledgers from tools/gfx1250/
out/
# 0915 scheduler runtime state: PID files and per-job container PIDs, meaningless outside
# the session that produced them. The ledger, events and queue ARE tracked -- they are the
# evidence every conclusion in output/0915__opt/ rests on.
output/*/run/
output/*/sched.pid
output/*/STOP

# rocprofv3 scratch, written into cwd by the profiling agent
.rocprofv3/
